        "TileImage": "$($repository fb2670e1-e16d-4e66-bb04-12e5d6e5bcb0).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47. Your targets today are conspiring to ride away in their helicopter to get eloped without their families consent. Mr. Marevick has seen this as a sin against God and would like to remove his son and his &quot;fling&quot;, as he put it, from the gene pool. As this is a rather weird task by itself, why don&apos;t you add  a more &quot;dramatic flair.&quot; \r\rI shall leave you to prepare, and as always, Good Luck",
